Orca (https://github.com/stablyai/orca)
--------------------------------------
iCode's detached terminal-host ownership model, authenticated local protocol,
durable-session / PTY-incarnation split, and headless-terminal snapshot strategy
are architectural adaptations informed by Orca. No Orca application components
were imported into this Work 1 scaffold.

